---
/** The Stopwatch mark: an amber tile with a navy stopwatch whose hand ticks once a second. */
---
<span class="logo-tile" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
    <circle cx="14" cy="16" r="9.5" stroke="#14233B" stroke-width="2.6"/>
    <path d="M11 3h6M14 3v3.5M22.6 7.4l1.6-1.6" stroke="#14233B" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path class="logo-hand" d="M14 16V10" stroke="#14233B" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <circle cx="14" cy="16" r="1.8" fill="#14233B"/>
  </svg>
</span>
